note src/ans/ans.om -- pure seeded OM-2 Alignment Navigation System (ANS v1)
note and embedded EST-0/EST-1 linear Kalman filter.
note Replaces src/ans/ans.c, src/ans/ans_encode.c, src/ans/ans.h.
note Advisory only: zero heap, zero threads, zero syscalls, zero authority.

